पश्यत्यकृतबुद्धित्वान्न स पश्यति दुर्मति: ॥ १६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4527,\"bb\":3971,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/16/b3971/\",\"body_value\":\"tatraivaṁ sati kartāram
ātmānaṁ kevalaṁ tu yaḥ
